cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "silosim: an agent-based model of Silo 18"
abstract: >-
  An agent-based simulation of Silo 18 from the TV series Silo, written in Go.
  About 10,000 people live under the Pact for centuries in a closed 144-floor
  silo. A frozen baseline covers demography, health, work, resources and
  governance; further modules add space, social ties, beliefs, regime control,
  rebellion, regime response and Silo 1. Runs are deterministic, and the model
  is specified with the ODD protocol.
authors:
  - given-names: Adam
    family-names: Kopřiva
repository-code: "https://github.com/skrilexxx/silo-sim"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - agent-based model
  - social simulation
  - rebellion
  - legitimacy
  - ODD protocol
  - Go
